  "title": "Unit 1: Sociology Definition, Social Institutions Overview, Key Terms, Common Sense, Sociological Imagination, Theories (Structuralism, Functionalism, Social Action)",
  "language": "en",
  "intro": "Move from everyday assumptions to evidence-based social explanation. Both approved decks introduce the vocabulary; the longer deck extends the material to sociological imagination, structuralism, functionalism and social action.",
